@startuml
title User Registration
participant Guest participant React_Login/Register participant DRF_API participant User/Profile participant PostgreSQL
Guest -> React_Login/Register : Enter username, email, password
React_Login/Register -> DRF_API : POST /api/users/register/ [API-010]
DRF_API -> User/Profile : Validate password; create User
User/Profile -> PostgreSQL : Signal creates Profile
DRF_API -> React_Login/Register : 201 Registration successful
React_Login/Register -> Guest : Redirect to /login
@enduml
